{"id":"ai_agents","title":"What is an AI agent?","ig_caption":"A chatbot talks. An AI agent acts. Here's the difference in 60 seconds.","hashtags":["#ai","#aiagents","#artificialintelligence","#howitworks","#tech"],
"objects":[{"prefab":"chip","id":"agent","pos":[0,0.2,0],"scale":2.2},{"prefab":"laptop","id":"lp","pos":[-4,0,-2],"scale":1.5,"rot":[0,0.8,0]},{"prefab":"globe","id":"web","pos":[4.5,0,-3],"scale":1.2},{"prefab":"phone","id":"ph","pos":[3.6,0.9,3],"rot":[0,-0.6,0],"screen":"text","text":"Booked","scale":1.4},{"prefab":"lock","id":"lk","pos":[-3.4,0,3.2],"scale":1.6}],
"beats":[
{"say":"A chatbot *talks*. | An AI agent *acts*.","cam":{"look":"agent","dist":7,"az":20,"el":22,"orbit":25},"fx":[{"t":"ring","on":"agent.core","r":1.8,"n":3,"color":"#7a6bff"}]},
{"say":"You give it a goal, | like \"book me a flight\".","cam":{"look":"agent","dist":5,"az":-20,"el":18,"orbit":20},"fx":[{"t":"label","on":"agent.core","text":"Goal: book a flight","dy":-150},{"t":"pulse","on":"agent.core","r":0.2,"beats":3}]},
{"say":"First, it *plans* the steps. | Search, compare, decide.","cam":{"look":"agent","dist":6,"az":30,"el":28,"orbit":-25},"fx":[{"t":"sparkle","on":"agent.core","r":1.0,"n":60,"color":"#c0b0ff"},{"t":"stat","value":"1  2  3","sub":"plan the steps","at":0.6,"y":20}]},
{"say":"Then it uses *tools*. | It can search the web.","cam":{"look":[1.5,1,-1],"dist":11,"az":10,"el":14,"orbit":18},"fx":[{"t":"beam","from":"agent.core","to":"web","arc":1.2,"color":"#6ac1ff"},{"t":"label","on":"web","text":"Web search","dy":-120,"at":0.6}]},
{"say":"Open apps. Fill in forms. | Even write *code*.","cam":{"look":[-1.5,1,-1],"dist":11,"az":-15,"el":14,"orbit":-18},"fx":[{"t":"beam","from":"agent.core","to":"lp.screen","arc":1.2,"color":"#ff6ad5"},{"t":"label","on":"lp.screen","text":"Apps + code","dy":-120,"at":0.6}]},
{"say":"After every step, it *checks* | what happened.","cam":{"look":"agent","dist":6,"az":0,"el":20,"orbit":25},"fx":[{"t":"ring","on":"agent.core","r":2,"n":4,"color":"#38e0b0","speed":0.8},{"t":"label","on":"agent.core","text":"Did it work?","dy":-150}]},
{"say":"If something fails, | it *tries* another way.","cam":{"look":"agent","dist":5.5,"az":-30,"el":16,"orbit":25},"fx":[{"t":"color","obj":"agent.core","to":"#ff4f6e","dur":0.8},{"t":"color","obj":"agent.core","to":"#38e0b0","at":1.8,"dur":0.8}]},
{"say":"That's why permissions matter. | You decide what it can *touch*.","cam":{"look":"lk","dist":4.5,"az":-20,"el":14,"orbit":20},"fx":[{"t":"label","on":"lk.body","text":"You set the limits","dy":-140},{"t":"ring","on":"lk.body","r":0.9,"n":3,"color":"#ffd45c"}]},
{"say":"Goal in. Result out. | That's an *agent*.","cam":{"look":"ph","dist":4.5,"az":-20,"el":10,"orbit":25},"fx":[{"t":"beam","from":"agent.core","to":"ph","arc":1.4,"color":"#38e0b0"},{"t":"pulse","on":"ph.screen","r":0.1,"beats":3}]}]}
